OL,3,AJensen Huang's Nvidia comeback sees
OL,4,Astock markets rise - but Trump faces
OL,5,Abacklash for his role
OL,6,
OL,7,FStock markets have risen across Asia
OL,8,Fafter Jensen Huang's comeback as Nvidia
OL,9,Fboss on Monday
OL,11,FShares in the company itself rose by
OL,12,F31% on Monday - and there have been
OL,13,Fknock-on effects worldwide, including
OL,14,Fin companies that supply Nvidia
OL,16,FFootage of Huang's return to Nvidia HQ
OL,17,Fwas posted online - "Thank you all for
OL,18,Fthe second chances," he told cheering
OL,19,Femployees
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
