OL,3,AJensen Huang's Nvidia comeback sees
OL,4,Astock markets rise - but Trump faces
OL,5,Abacklash for his role
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Trump says he "made the deal"
OL,8,Fto bring Huang back - but that has
OL,9,Fsparked a backlash from US politicians
OL,11,FTrump has bought millions of dollars in
OL,12,FNvidia stock in the past two years
OL,14,FHuang stepped down from Nvidia after
OL,15,Fadmitting to an affair with an alleged
OL,16,FChinese spy, and was also accused of an
OL,17,Faffair with a colleague. Here's a
OL,18,Ftimeline of how we got here
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
